  "title": "LegalZoom to Announce First Quarter 2026 Financial Results on Wednesday, May 6, 2026",
  "summary": "MOUNTAIN VIEW, Calif., April 15, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- LegalZoom (Nasdaq: LZ), a leading online platform for legal services, today announced it will report its financial results for the first quarter ended March 31, 2026, on Wednesday, May 6, 2026, after the close of market.",
